 zooms and rotates the map. Images may also be used as icons or patterns","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in a style layer. To register an image for use as an icon or pattern,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/setImage:forName:","type":"reference"},{"text":" method. To configure a point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"annotation’s image, use the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationImage","type":"reference"},{"text":" class.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNImageSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/initWithIdentifier:shapes:options:":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a shape source with an identifier, an array of shapes, and a dictionary of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"options for the source."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"initWithIdentifier:shapes:options:","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:shapes:options:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shapes:options:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/initwithidentifier:shapes:options:","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNShape","type":"topic","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShape"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MLNStyle","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/shape":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The contents of the source. A shape can represent a GeoJSON geometry, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature, or a collection of features."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"shape","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"shape","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/shape","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterDEMSource":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNRasterDEMSource","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrasterdemsource","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterDEMSource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterDEMSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies rasterized"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"digital elevation model"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(DEM) tiles to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tiles are defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conforms to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A raster DEM source is added to an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHillshadeStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNColorReliefStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects. Use a hillshade"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"style layer to control the appearance of content supplied by the raster DEM source,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or a color relief style layer to render elevation data with a color ramp."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNRasterDEMSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/initWithIdentifier:features:options:":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a shape source with an identifier, an array of features, and a dictionary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of options for the source."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"initWithIdentifier:features:options:","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:features:options:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:features:options:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/initwithidentifier:features:options:","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNHillshadeStyleLayer":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHillshadeStyleLayer","fragments":[{"text":"MLNH